# The spawner module's input action in the sandbox: key R (declared by the module through the
# contract crate) runs `spawner.rain 1`, so one tap drops one blue box.
# Run: cargo run -p retreat_sandbox -- --headless --commands scripts/verify/module_spawner_input.cmds
# Expected picture:
#   module_spawner_input.png: one small blue box at rest on the ground (rain_1) next to the cube.

input.tap R
# 3 s of simulation time: the box lands and settles.
wait 192
assert.entity_exists rain_1
snapshot module_spawner_input
state.hash
assert.state_hash 0x371265e85c3ce1cb
quit
